      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2013 Revista Iberoamericana de Micología. Published by Elsevier Espana. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "A case of fungemia with interstitial lung compromise caused by Malassezia sympodialis is reported in an obese pediatric patient on long-term treatment with inhaled corticosteroids for asthma. The patient was hospitalized due to a post-surgical complication of appendicitis. The patient was treated with amphotericin B for 3 weeks, with good clinical evolution and subsequent negative cultures."
      },
